{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oS0nWGTYaX3UlIYN0FRfQg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:27.545274+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oS0nWGTYaX3UlIYN0FRfQg","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>中国科学院上海高等研究院</span></span></strong><span><span>（以下简称“上海高研院”）是由中国科学院和上海市人民政府共建的科研机构，坐落于上海张江，</span></span><strong><span><span>以先进光源大科学装置的研制、建设和运行为核心，开展加速器科学、光子科学、能源科学与信息科学领域的原始创新研究和关键核心技术研发</span></span><span><span>，</span></span></strong><span><span>支撑前沿科学研究，为战略新兴产业提供核心技术和集成技术解决方案。</span></span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海高研院已构建起多元育人矩阵，</span></span><strong><span><span>在培养层次上涵盖从博士到硕士，在育人方向上兼顾学术型与专业型，</span></span></strong><span><span>具体包括6个一级学科博士/硕士培养点、1个工程博士培养点以及3个硕士专业学位授权领域。同时，还与上海科技大学、张江实验室等高校和科研院所开展</span></span><strong><span><span>科教融合、协同育人</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>目前，上海高研院已与美国、德国、英国、法国、意大利、瑞士、日本等国家的顶尖高校与科研机构并肩探索，与跨国企业携手推进技术产业化。在这里，科技交流、多边协作以及开放共享的科研环境与全球统筹的资源网络，让你的学术视野从起步就与世界同步。</span></span></p><p><span><span>未来，上海高研院愿为追梦路上的你保驾护航：国家奖学金、中国科学院大学各类专项奖学金、上海高研院企业奖学金等多重奖励体系，叠加丰厚的助学金与生活补贴，让你拥有沉潜科研的底气，更专注于在科学的星辰大海中扬帆远航。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>向全国优秀学子发出诚挚邀约</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>如果你手握推荐免试资格，渴望在物理学、化学、电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程、化学工程与技术、核科学与技术学科，以及电子信息、材料与化工、生物与医药等领域绽放才华，这里将是你从优秀走向卓越的起点。</span></span></p><p><span><span>加入上海高研院，让科研理想扎根中国大地，让创新力量映照世界舞台 —— 我们等你来，共赴一场改变未来的科学之约！</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>01</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生导师</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong></strong><p><span><span>上海高研院现有导师212名，导师介绍及研究方向信息可查询研究生教育栏目下师资队伍介绍。</span></span></p><p><span><span>导师介绍链接：</span></span></p><p><span><span>http://www.sari.cas.cn/gradedu/szdw/gykx/gzkx/ </span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>02</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kBBPFia7C60X6Punrs0YZcLmVqfUmOSS4Afjr9icNbJ4P4zibKd3VrSqHgPqof6FianVcvO5g2iaX20NL13WF6eKc8Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>03</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p><span><span>申请上海高研院推荐免试研究生（含直博生）应具备如下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，道德品质良好，遵纪守法；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. 须获得所在学校当年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）资格，并在教育部中国研究生招生信息网</span></span><strong><span><span>“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”</span></span></strong><span><span>（以下简称“推免服务系统”）中获得母校推荐免试资格名单备案；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 诚实守信，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，热爱科学事业，具有较好的科研潜力，有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 外语程度良好，具有较强的外语听、说、读、写能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. 身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></p><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>即日起至</span><strong><span><span>2025年9月28日</span></span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（可视招生及高校推免等实际情况适当延长）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><strong><span>（一）</span></strong></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>网上报名</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 登录：获得所读高校推荐免试资格的考生，可通过中国科学院大学招生信息网进行申请，</span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span><span>http://admission.ucas.ac.cn</span></p><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kBBPFia7C60X6Punrs0YZcLmVqfUmOSS4D82V0DHiczPm220DzR1DI498NnTxmT1ibUiayyPjTQVBbvWGgtjER0EOQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p></section><p><span><span><span>2. 注册：在</span></span><span><span>报考单位搜索框</span></span><span><span>内输入“</span><strong><span>上海高等研究院</span></strong><span>”进行报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 填报：</span><span><span>“推荐免试生申请系统”</span></span><span>中</span><strong><span>可暂不填报导师，研究方向可任选一个</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><strong><span>（二）</span></strong></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>通过</span><strong><span>国科大招生信息网推荐免试申请系统</span></strong><span>报名后，须于</span><strong><span><span>9月28日前</span></span></strong><span>提交电子扫描件材料</span></span><span><span>（按以下顺序整理打包成PDF文档，文档及邮件主题命名格式为：</span></span><strong><span>本科学校及专业+姓名+2026年推免生申请</span></strong><span><span>，发送至指定邮箱：zhaosheng@sari.ac.cn）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span><strong><span>《中国科学院大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生/直博生申请表》</span></strong><span>，申请表可以通过报名系统中的报表途径在线打印，经申请人签字确认有效 </span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 所在学校（或院系）教务部门加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修</span></span><strong><span><span>课程成绩单</span></span></strong><span><span>（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单） </span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 个人简历及专业学习</span></span><strong><span><span>情况介绍</span></span></strong><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 有效</span></span><strong><span><span>居民身份证</span></span></strong><span><span>正反面扫描件（正反面放在一张A4纸同一面上） </span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><strong><span><span>英语等级证</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>6.</span></span><strong><span><span>政审表</span></span></strong><span><span>（见附件1）</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.</span></span><strong><span><span>其他</span></span></strong><span><span>自愿提交的材料：大学期间获奖证书复印件；在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其它原创性工作成果的复印件或证明；对申请有参考价值的其他材料等。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>接收程序</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><strong><span>（一）</span></strong></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>初审</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong></strong></span><p><span><span><span>上海高研院将对申请人提交的申请材料进行初审，并通过</span></span><strong><span><span>邮件</span></span></strong><span><span>形式通知符合条件的申请人参加复试。</span></span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><strong><span>（二）</span></strong></span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>考核</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>上海高研院组织考核小组对申请者进行考核，以面试为主</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span><strong><span>内容主要包括思想政治品德考核、专业知识和外语考核。</span></strong><span>考核将根据申报及材料提交等情况，分批进行，具体时间、地点及方式等信息将通过邮件或电话方式通知同意参加复试考生。</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><strong><span><span>思想政治品德考核</span></span></strong></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>思想政治品德考核</span></span></strong><span><span>主要考查考生的政治态度、思想品德、人生观、价值观、工作学习态度、团队合作精神、科研道德及遵纪守法等方面的基本情况。思想品德考核不合格的申请者不予录取。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>有下列情形之一且未能提供对错误的认识及改正错误的现实表现等证明材料的，应认定为思想政治品德考核不合格： </span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 有反对宪法所确定的基本原则的言行或参加邪教组织，情节严重的； </span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 触犯治安管理处罚法，受到治安管理处罚且情节严重、性质恶劣的。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>专业知识考核</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>专业知识考核</span></span></strong><span><span>重点考查考生对知识掌握的深度和广度，对知识灵活运用的程度以及考生的实验技能和实际动手能力等，了解考生从事科研工作的潜力和创造性。考核既核查学生历年的学习成绩，特别是本科所学专业主干课程成绩，同时注重对学生的学习能力、创新精神和其他特长等综合素质方面的考查。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><strong><span>外语考核</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>外语考核</span></span></strong><span><span>主要考查考生的听、说能力及语言运用能力。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><strong><span><span><span>面试成绩以100分计算，为思想政治品德考核、专业知识和外语考核三项（</span></span><span><span>每项满分100分</span></span><span><span>）成绩的平均值。面试成绩60分及以上合格，不合格者不予录取。</span></span></span></strong></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>（三）</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>体检</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>考核通过后，将另行通知体检事项。体检主要考查考生的身体健康状况，也包括体能、体质和心理素质等方面的考查。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>体检由考生</span></strong><strong><span><span>自行在当地二级甲等以上医院进行</span></span></strong><strong><span>，体检结果必须贴有本人照片并在照片与体检单交接处加盖骑缝公章。附件2体检表供参考，也可使用体检医院表格，体检内容包含附件所列内容即可。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>*</span></strong><span>体检标准：参照教育部、卫生部、中国残联印发的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔2003〕3号）要求，按照人力资源和社会保障部、教育部、卫生部《关于进一步规范入学和就业体检项目维护乙肝表面抗原携带者入学和就业权利的通知》（人社部发〔2010〕12号）规定要求执行。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>新生入学后需进行体检复查。</span></span></strong><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>（四）</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>拟录取</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 上海高研院招生工作领导小组对面试和体检结果进行审议，按照</span></span><strong><span><span>“德智体全面衡量、择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥”</span></span></strong><span><span>的原则确定拟录取名单并进行公示。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 拟录取的推荐免试研究生（含直博生）必须在规定的时间内，通过教育部“推免服务系统”完成</span></span><strong><span><span>网上报名、接受复试通知、接受拟录取通知</span></span></strong><span><span>等报考接收程序。（截至规定时间仍未完成相关接收手续或未落实接收单位的推荐免试生不再保留推荐免试接收资格）</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><strong><span><span>录取层次</span></span></strong><span><span>（硕士研究生或直博生）、</span></span><strong><span><span>录取类型</span></span></strong><span><span>（学术型硕士研究生或专业型硕士研究生）、</span></span><strong><span><span>录取专业和学习方式</span></span></strong><span><span>（全日制）等以</span></span><strong><span><span>教育部“推免服务系统”确认的信息</span></span></strong><span><span>为准，后期各工作阶段不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 被拟录取的推荐免试生</span></span><strong><span><span>不得再以</span></span></strong><span><span>统考生身份报名参加全国硕士生统一入学考试。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 推荐免试生的录取类别一般为</span></span><strong><span><span>计划内非定向</span></span></strong><span><span>，学习方式为</span></span><strong><span><span>全日制</span></span></strong><span><span>。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>6. 对拟录取的推荐免试生，通过教育部</span></span><strong><span><span>审核通过</span></span></strong><span><span>后，与对应统考生同时发放录取通知书。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>07</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学制</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong></strong><p><span><span>1.</span><strong><span>推荐免试硕士研究生</span></strong><span>基本学制一般为</span><strong><span>3</span></strong><span>年，最长修读年限（含休学）不得超过</span><strong><span>4</span></strong><span>年。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><strong><span>推荐免试直博生</span></strong><span>基本学制一般为</span><strong><span>5</span></strong><span>年，最长修读年限（含休学）不得超过</span><strong><span>8</span></strong><span>年。 </span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>08</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>特别申明</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1. 请必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。因申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确而造成的一切后果，由申请人自行承担。</span></span><strong><span><span>对拟录取的推荐免试生，出现下列情况之一的，取消其录取资格：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 在本科阶段最后一学年（四年制的指第七、八学期，五年制的指第九、十学期）专业主干课程学习成绩有不及格科目；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 毕业设计（论文）未取得良好以上（含良好）成绩； </span></span></p><p><span><span>(3) 毕业时未获得本科毕业证书或学士学位； </span></span></p><p><span><span>(4) 政审不合格； </span></span></p><p><span><span>(5) 考试作弊者或违纪（法）受到“警告”以上处分的，或有其他情节严重的违法乱纪行为受到处罚者；</span></span></p><p><span><span>(6) 申请人提交的材料有弄虚作假者。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 体检表待面试通过后另行通知提交（见附件）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 2026年4月，将对拟录取的推荐免试生在本科阶段最后一学年的学习成绩和遵纪守法表现进行复审。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 本公告未尽报考事宜，请后续参看《中国科学院上海高等研究院2026年招收攻读硕士学位研究生简章》和《中国科学院上海高等研究院2026年招收攻读博士学位研究生简章》。 </span></span></p><p><span><span>5. 本公告如有与国家新出台的招生政策或中国科学院大学相关文件要求（含相关时间节点）不符的事项，以上级单位新政策或文件为准。</span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>PART.</span></strong><strong><span>09</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>联系人：肖老师；钟老师 </span></span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span>联系电话：021-20325020；</span></span><span><span>021-20325106 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail:  zhaosheng@sari.ac.cn </span></span></p><p><span><span>联系地址：上海市浦东新区张江高科技园区海科路99号综合楼322室 研究生处 </span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：201210 </span></span></p><span></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong></strong><p><span><span>附件：</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oS0nWGTYaX3UlIYN0FRfQg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国科学院上海高等研究院招收推荐免试研究生个人政治审查材料.docx</a></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oS0nWGTYaX3UlIYN0FRfQg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中国科学院上海高等研究院推免生体检表.docx</a></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/kBBPFia7C60X6Punrs0YZcLmVqfUmOSS4jGibSFaCVnWsoicpic5pJY3FCXQcDTxX0mTvd5W9ATUIQ0ibvZDDzJibvyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>上海高等研究院</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>排版：刘思源</span></span></section><section><span><span>审核：刘军 肖丽君</span></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cd40d15eecde6a6f4cbffad7331c16ee2442de1348165bf679c1ec89862e13c0","textLength":3789,"sourceSha256":"aedc3ed83554e29d00eb54e24d6b2ff6fe7457d81a67e7dce48bd57347073c37","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-420c903b7d631c92f663","title":"2025年中国科学院上海高等研究院2026年推荐免试研究生招收公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:27.545274+00:00"}
